{
  "description": "Complete mapping of BuffGroupType enum values to implementing buff classes. The 'group' field in ConfigBuff sets the buffType used for getBuffByType() lookups. The 'action' field in ConfigBuff determines which class instantiates the buff via buffMap.",
  "sourceLines": {
    "buffMap_registration": 332125,
    "BuffGroupType_enum": 278632,
    "ConfigBuff_schema": 222479,
    "addBuff_factory": 431489,
    "buffType_assignment": 192065
  },
  "notes": [
    "buffType = config.group (BuffGroupType value) - used for runtime buff querying via getBuffByType()",
    "action = config.action (string key) - used for instantiation via buffMap[action](config)",
    "Multiple action types can share the same group value",
    "A buff class may not correspond to any group if it is not queried by type at runtime"
  ],
